 "face": {
  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "The eyes are glossy lenses (lo_eyes) with the big black pupil, the warm grey-brown iris, the catchlights and the upper lash line baked into the atlas; the brows, the lash flicks, the blush and the two small smiles beside the trunk are baked into the body. No face sheet and no morphs: expressions in clips' `faces` are hints only. Blinking scales the blink bones (play `blink` over any clip): each lens squashes onto the closed lid's lash line and sinks into the head, showing the closed lid sculpted and painted under it. The trunk's bud opens on its petal bones (bud.1..5) in idle_happy, pet, celebrate and win.",
